  "description": "Yoon I-Gyeong slept with a man. With Cha Seon-Ho, his landlord who changes men every week like clockwork. Seon-Ho seems to represent non-romance on the surface, casually moving from one affair to the next, yet secretly dreams of romance. Watching Seon-Ho exhausted from his one-sided love, I-Gyeong began to want something more than just one night with him.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
